---
layout: main
title: Agent Skills & Executable Context
description: Koleksi Agent Skills (SKILL.md) dan indeks konteks terstruktur yang siap ditarik langsung oleh Claude Code, Cursor, Antigravity, Amp, dan CLI AI agents.
permalink: /skills/
pageCss: prompts.css
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<main id="main-content" class="container prompts-index skills-index" data-pagefind-body data-pagefind-meta="title:Agent Skills & Executable Context">
  <div class="articles-header">
    <h2>AGENT SKILLS</h2>
    <div class="rss-pill">
      🤖 {{ collections.prompts | length }} SKILL.MD
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="articles-intro">
    Setiap pola kerja dan mental model di situs ini juga tersedia sebagai berkas standar <code>SKILL.md</code> serta manifes JSON (<code>/skills/index.json</code>) yang bisa ditarik langsung ke dalam konteks AI coding agent (Claude Code, Cursor, Antigravity, Amp, Pi) lewat satu perintah terminal.
  </p>

  <section class="skills-quickstart-box" aria-labelledby="skills-quickstart-heading">
    <div class="prompt-workbench-bar">
      <span id="skills-quickstart-heading" class="prompt-workbench-label">⚡ TARIK MANIFES ATAU SKILL KE AGENT (&lt; 30 DETIK)</span>
      <div class="prompt-workbench-actions">
        <a class="prompt-raw-link" href="/skills/index.json">📦 index.json</a>
        <a class="prompt-raw-link" href="/llms.txt">📄 llms.txt</a>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="prompt-copy-btn"
          data-copy-text="curl -fsSL https://rizafahmi.com/skills/index.json | jq '.skills[] | {name, category, skillUrl, installCommand}'">
          Salin Perintah JSON
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <pre class="prompt-workbench-pre"><code># 1. Lihat seluruh daftar skill &amp; endpoint secara terstruktur:
curl -fsSL https://rizafahmi.com/skills/index.json

# 2. Pasang salah satu skill langsung ke direktori .agents/skills/ proyekmu:
mkdir -p .agents/skills/wawancara-spesifikasi-bertahap &amp;&amp; \
  curl -fsSL https://rizafahmi.com/skills/wawancara-spesifikasi-bertahap/SKILL.md \
  -o .agents/skills/wawancara-spesifikasi-bertahap/SKILL.md

# 3. Atau tarik catatan teknis utuh dalam format Markdown mentah:
curl -fsSL https://rizafahmi.com/catatan/agentic-coding-bag-3.md</code></pre>
  </section>

  <div class="skills-Format-pills">
    <a class="prompt-raw-link" href="/prompts/">🎛️ Buka Parameter Workbench (/prompts/) &rarr;</a>
    <a class="prompt-raw-link" href="/showcase/">🛠️ Lihat Bukti Karya Open Source (/showcase/) &rarr;</a>
  </div>

  {%- for cat in collections.promptCategories %}
  <section id="{{ cat.id }}" class="prompt-category-section">
    <div class="prompt-section-header">
      <h3>{{ cat.label }}</h3>
      <span class="prompt-section-count">{{ cat.count }} skill</span>
    </div>

    <ul class="prompts-grid">
      {%- for item in cat.items %}
      <li class="prompt-card skill-card">
        <div class="prompt-card-topbar">
          <div class="prompt-card-badges">
            <span class="prompt-badge prompt-badge--category">{{ item.categoryShortLabel }}</span>
            <span class="prompt-badge">SKILL.MD</span>
          </div>
          <div class="skill-card-actions">
            <a class="prompt-raw-link" href="{{ item.skillUrl }}" title="Unduh SKILL.md mentah">SKILL.md</a>
            <button
              type="button"
              class="prompt-card-copy"
              data-copy-text="{{ item.installCommand | escape }}"
              aria-label="Salin perintah install skill {{ item.slug }}">
              Salin curl
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a class="prompt-card-link" href="{{ item.url }}">
          <span class="prompt-card-title">{{ item.displayTitle | safe }}</span>
          <span class="prompt-card-meta"><code>/skills/{{ item.slug }}/SKILL.md</code></span>
          <span class="prompt-card-desc">{{ item.description }}</span>
          <pre class="prompt-card-preview"><code>{{ item.installCommand }}</code></pre>
          <span class="prompt-card-cta">Buka Workbench &amp; Parameter &rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>
  {%- endfor %}

  <hr />
  <a class="back" href="/">&lt; KEMBALI KE BERANDA</a>
</main>

<script type="module" src="/assets/prompts.js?v={{ site.buildTime }}"></script>
